	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Two 1.6 x 2.4 mm pads on the top (the old cut-and-wire pads' size, the user: easy to solder on), 7.62 mm apart, for a leaded 1/4 W resistor in parallel with one of the tuning 0603s (R1, R5, R6): no soldering on the SMD part's ends (the user, 2026-11-08). Plain pads, no hole (the user, 2026-11-08 evening: a leaded part soldered flat on the surface, no through-holes). Used by RT1 on the long board, both pads wired on the top (RT5 and RT6 have their pads apart: twins.pretty, written by make_board.py). Not placed by the fab.")
	(tags "resistor parallel tuning pads")
